<view class="page theme-{{theme}}"
  ><view class="hero-title">行情提醒</view
  ><view class="hero-sub">把关注交给提醒，把时间留给生活。</view>
  <view class="panel quota-panel"
    ><view class="section-row"
      ><view
        ><view wx:if="{{hasPortfolio}}" class="section-title"
          >{{activeCount}} / {{limits.activeRules}}
          <text class="micro">条提醒已开启</text></view
        ><view wx:if="{{hasStatus}}" class="muted"
          >播报授权 {{quota.brief}} 次 · 异动 {{quota.vol}} 次</view
        ></view
      ><button
        class="primary compact"
        bindtap="onAuthTap"
        loading="{{authBusy}}"
        disabled="{{authBusy}}"
      >
        增加授权
      </button></view
    ><view class="foot">每次同意订阅，可增加对应模板 1 次授权。</view></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载提醒…</view
  ><view wx:elif="{{hasPortfolio && !groups.length}}" class="empty"
    ><view class="empty-title">还没有设置提醒</view
    ><view class="muted">从「自选」打开标的，即可设置专属提醒。</view></view
  >
  <view
    wx:for="{{groups}}"
    wx:key="id"
    class="panel"
    data-id="{{item.id}}"
    bindtap="openAsset"
    role="button"
    aria-label="管理{{item.name}}提醒"
    ><view class="section-row"
      ><view
        ><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view
        ><view class="code">{{item.code}} · {{item.market}}</view></view
      ><view class="muted manage-link">管理<view class="chev" aria-hidden="true"></view></view></view
    ><view
      wx:for="{{item.rules}}"
      wx:for-item="rule"
      wx:key="id"
      class="summary-row"
      ><text>{{rule.summary}}</text
      ><text class="micro">{{rule.enabled ? '已开启' : '已暂停'}}</text></view
    ></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{recent.length}}" class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">最近提醒</view>
    <view wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="taskId" class="recent-task">
      <view class="section-row"
        ><text>{{item.assetName}}</text
        ><text class="micro">{{item.statusText}}</text></view
      >
      <view wx:if="{{item.reasonText}}" class="muted">{{item.reasonText}}</view>
      <view class="micro">{{item.timeText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="foot"
    >后台约每 1
    分钟监测，行情和推送均可能延迟。每标的每类每日最多 1 条；每天常规最多 6 条、到价最多 4 条，共享微信授权次数。免打扰时间可在「我的」修改。</view
  >
</view>
